{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"What I really want out of bringing others in is to provide more content and to double check our work for balance. I like to inject my personality into the game, which is why I choose to get my touch on as much of \"flavor\" as I can . Co-creating is great. I had a particular style of dark fairy whimsy for roanoke, and for empire city im going for a tone shift. I'm keeping editorial control but when some one does something well that I don't want to touch, like rob and crafting I'm far more hands off. Part of my design philosophy is is that I am here to accommodate other creators and build a community.","created_at":"2020-08-24T22:54:00.737000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747589560380424213","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
